# data/
# This directory is created automatically by add-claw.sh and stores:
#   - key-registry.txt  (per-user OpenRouter key hashes)
#   - admin.db          (admin dashboard database)
#   - credits.db        (credit tracking database)
#   - *.log             (health, billing, report logs)
#
# All database and log files are gitignored.
# This .gitkeep ensures the directory exists in the repository.
